 "需要人机验证（是否启用待决策，08 §13.3）",\n      "action": "拉起人机验证组件，通过后带验证凭证重放",\n      "retry": "验证后",\n      "retry_kind": "after_action",\n      "sources": [\n        "BR-ID-05",\n        "BR-ID-32"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      "code": 50001,\n      "http": 500,\n      "meaning": "服务端错误",\n      "action": "通用错误态 + trace_id 后 6 位",\n      "retry": "是",\n      "retry_kind": "immediate",\n      "sources": [\n        "BR-TEXT-14",\n        "BR-INV-06"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      "code": 50301,\n      "http": 503,\n      "meaning": "平台维护或熔断，或平台未开放",\n      "action": "maintenance 弹 Toast、购买按钮禁用；not_launched 购买按钮禁用、不弹 Toast；无 reason 按 maintenance",\n      "retry": "maintenance：稍后；not_launched：否",\n      "retry_kind": "later",\n      "retry_kind_by_reason": {\n        "maintenance": "later",\n        "not_launched": "never"\n      },\n      "data": {\n        "platform": null,\n        "reason": [\n          "maintenance",\n          "not_launched"\n        ]\n      },\n      "sources": [\n        "BR-TEXT-14",\n        "BR-PRICE-13",\n        "BR-PROD-05",\n        "BR-PROD-10"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      "code": 50302,\n      "http": 503,\n      "meaning": "AI 暂不可用（只在服务端按关键词无模型出卡也失败时返回）",\n      "action": "跳搜索",\n      "retry": "稍后",\n      "retry_kind": "later",\n      "data": {\n        "fallback": null\n      },\n      "sources": [\n        "BR-TEXT-14",\n        "BR-AI-14"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      "code": 50303,\n      "http": 503,\n      "meaning": "暂时无法确认价格或生成链接（点击复核失败且无缓存，或取价成功但转链失败）",\n      "action": "不外跳返利链接；给重试主按钮与无返利购买次按钮（BR-PRICE-08）",\n      "retry": "稍后",\n      "retry_kind": "later",\n      "sources": [\n        "BR-PRICE-08",\n        "BR-PRICE-13"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      "code": 50304,\n      "http": 503,\n      "meaning": "某平台搜索暂不可用（data.platform；联盟超时、限流或熔断且无可用搜索缓存，不改读商品池冒充）；该平台的搜索开关 search.enabled.<platform> 关闭时带 data.reason=search_disabled（BR-PROD-10 细则「按平台的搜索开关」）",\n      "action": "无 reason：搜索页显示空态与重试按钮；Agent 改查其他平台。search_disabled：不显示重试