  map.set('contracts/openapi.json', '{\n  "openapi": "3.1.0",\n  "info": {\n    "title": "Couli rebate-platform API",\n    "version": "0.9.0",\n    "summary": "Shared HTTP contract for the app, H5, admin console and backend.",\n    "description": "Single source for endpoints (D17); error codes and enums live in contracts/error-codes.yaml and\\ncontracts/enums/*.yaml. Conventions: 规划/04 §5; authoring rules: contracts/README.md.\\nv0.9 (CT-02a) covers the path 登录 → 搜索 → 转链跳转; the rest is added per feature.\\n\\nEvery business response uses the envelope `{code, msg, data, trace_id}`; `code=0` is success.\\nOperation extensions: `x-auth` (none | optional | login | phone | realname, 04 §5),\\n`x-signed` (true = X-Timestamp / X-Nonce / X-Sign required, BR-ID-09),\\n`x-idempotent` (true = Idempotency-Key required, 04 §6 mark I),\\n`x-error-codes` (business codes the operation may return besides the common ones;\\nmeaning, client action and data shape per code in contracts/error-codes.yaml),\\n`x-implementation: planned` (declared ahead of its route, TECH-05; removed when the route\\nships, apps/api/src/contract.test.ts enforces both ways),\\n`x-step-up` (the step_up_action the `X-Step-Up-Token` header must carry, 04 §5; only the four\\noperations of the 04 §5 step-up row: POST /v1/withdrawals → withdraw, PUT\\n/v1/me/payout-account → payout_account_change, POST /v1/me/phone → phone_change,\\nPOST /v1/me/deletion → account_deletion. Such an operation is idempotent, lists the\\nX-Step-Up-Token parameter and the codes 10003 (token missing, expired or for another action)\\nand 20903 (its Idempotency-Key was abandoned through POST /v1/idempotency-keys/abandon).\\nWhen only some requests need step-up, the condition is written in the operation\\ndescription: POST /v1/me/phone needs it only for a change, not for a first binding).\\n`x-min-version-gate` (true | false | conditional, 04 §5 最低支持版本): on every /v1 write\\noperation (not on GET); true = a client of the three apps below the minimum supported\\nversion gets 10405; false and conditional only for the operations the interface table of\\nBR-ID-01 细则「最低支持版本的接口层拦截」 lists, the condition written in the description.\\n`x-session-scopes` (array of session_scope, 04 §5 受限会话): [full, deletion_only] on the\\noperations of the table in BR-ID-01 细则「受限会话」 (with the condition in the description\\nwhere only some request bodies are accepted); not marked = [full].\\nCommon codes any operation may return: 10401, 10402, 10403, 20001, 42901, 44001, 44002,\\n50001, 50401; with x-auth login also 10001, 10002, 10006; with Idempotency-Key also 20901,\\n40901. Any operation called with a bearer token may also return 10405 when it does not accept\\nthe token\'s session scope (x-session-scopes); operations whose version gate is true or\\nconditional, and the restricted logins, list 10405 in x-error-codes.\\n"\n  },\n  "servers": [\n    {\n      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:3100",\n      "description": "Local `api` entry (API_HOST / API_PORT defaults)."\n    }\n  ],\n  "tags": [\n    {\n      "name": "ops",\n      "description": "Operational probes. Not part of the product API and not versioned under /v1."\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "identity",\n      "description": "Device registration, SMS login, token refresh and the current user (04 §6.1)."\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "config",\n      "description": "Client configuration and switches (04 §6.2, §10.1)."\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "trade",\n      "description": "Search, product detail, input parsing, link open / convert, the link landing page and the share page (04 §6.3)."\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "union",\n      "description": "Union authorization and binding (04 §6.3)."\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "order",\n      "description": "Orders and pending-track cards (04 §6.4)."\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "fund",\n      "description": "Payout account, withdrawals, wallet and the earnings dashboard (04 §6.1, §6.4)."\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "content",\n      "description": "Articles, notices, update check, inbox messages and page preview (04 §6.2, §6.4)."\n    }\n  ],\n  "paths": {\n    "/healthz": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "getHealthz",\n        "tags": [\n          "ops"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Liveness probe",\n        "description": "Returns 200 as soon as the process has finished initialising. It checks no\\ndependency (database, cache, queue). Served by every HTTP entry.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "security": [],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The process is initialised.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthzResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "status": "ok",\n                    "entry": "api",\n                    "now": "2026-10-01T04:00:00.000Z"\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/devices": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "registerDevice",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Register a device",\n        "description": "Issues `device_id` and `install_secret` after the user has agreed to the privacy policy\\n(BR-ID-09). The client stores install_secret only in Keychain / Keystore / HUKS and signs\\nlater requests with it. Not signed: the device has no secret yet.\\n`device_hash` is lowercase_hex(SHA-256(UTF-8 bytes of the identifier with surrounding\\nwhitespace removed, lower-cased)) and `id_source` names the identifier (BR-ID-09 细则\\n「设备标识的无效值」; MVP Android uses ANDROID_ID only). The client never hashes an invalid\\nidentifier (empty, all zeros, wrong format). A hash of the wrong format, or one on the\\ninvalid-hash list (config device.invalid_hashes), is 20001 with `data.fields=[device_hash]`\\nand no device_id is issued; the client shows nothing and reads the identifier again\\ninstead of retrying the same value. Reaching the per-IP hourly registration limit is 42901\\nwith Retry-After (BR-ID-05 细则「发码与设备注册的风控默认值」).\\n`id_source` is required (04 §6.1, §3.2 devices). Making it required is not a breaking\\nchange: the operation is still planned (no route, no caller), and the oasdiff check leaves\\nplanned operations out of the base contract (tools/ci/oasdiff-base.ts).\\nVersion gate: not applied (session recovery, BR-ID-01 细则 interface table). Session scopes:\\naccepts deletion_only (BR-ID-01 细则「受限会话」).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": false,\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegisterDeviceRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "device_hash": "9f86d081884c7d659a2feaa0c55ad015a3bf4f1b2b0b822cd15d6c15b0f00a08",\n                "id_source": "idfv"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "Device registered.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegisterDeviceResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "device_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a60",\n                    "install_secret": "example-install-secret-value"\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/devices/push-token": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "reportPushToken",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Report the push token of this device",\n        "description": "Writes push_tokens through the notification module. The token value and its binding are\\nwritten only when the calling session is the latest login session of this device;\\notherwise the report is ignored. A token value already registered on another device row\\nis taken over or not according to device registration order and session creation time;\\na holder row that changed hands within the conflict window is frozen and reports during\\nthe freeze are not written (BR-ID-07 细则「推送令牌与会话」). Every case answers success.\\nThe client reports once after each successful login with the new session. provider is a\\nstring until the push provider is chosen (orchestrator decision D-14).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "login",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": true,\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReportPushTokenRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "provider": "placeholder-provider",\n                "token": "placeholder-push-token"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "Accepted (also when the report was ignored).",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EmptyResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {},\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/auth/sms-codes": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "sendSmsCode",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Send an SMS verification code",\n        "description": "Order of checks: signature 10401 / 10402 → 20001 → 44001 → 44003 → 42901 (BR-ID-05). Limits per\\nphone: 1 per 60 s, 10 per natural day (+08:00); a code is 6 digits and valid 5 minutes.\\n`phone` is normalised by the server (BR-ID-05 细则「手机号规范化」); when the result is not\\na mainland mobile number the answer is 20001 with `data.fields=[phone]` and\\n`data.reason=phone_invalid`, no SMS is sent and nothing counts towards the limits.\\nVersion gate (conditional, the table of BR-ID-01 细则 rules): not applied when purpose=login,\\nor purpose=step_up with action=account_deletion; applied otherwise (purpose=bind, or step_up\\nwithout action or with another action). Session scopes: a deletion_only session is accepted\\nonly for purpose=login and for purpose=step_up with action=account_deletion. Both conditions\\nfollow BR-ID-01 细则, which wins on any difference.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": "conditional",\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001,\n          44001,\n          44003,\n          42901,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Timestamp"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Nonce"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Sign"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SendSmsCodeRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "phone": "13800138000",\n                "purpose": "login"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The provider accepted the SMS.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SendSmsCodeResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "resend_after_sec": 60,\n                    "expires_in_sec": 300\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/auth/login/sms": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "loginBySms",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Log in (or register) with an SMS code",\n        "description": "Creates the account on first login. The request carries the legal versions the user\\nagreed to and the time of agreement (BR-ID-04). An `invite_code` is ignored for an\\nexisting account; `invite_bind` is present only when a non-empty invite_code was sent\\n(BR-INV-06). Errors: 20002 wrong code, 20003 expired code (BR-ID-05). `phone` is\\nnormalised by the server; a number that does not normalise to a mainland mobile number is\\n20001 with `data.fields=[phone]`, `data.reason=phone_invalid` (BR-ID-05 细则「手机号规范化」).\\nCreating the account checks the same-device registration limit (44001, BR-ID-05).\\nVersion gate: not applied (session recovery). A client below the minimum version gets a\\nrestricted login (BR-ID-01 细则「受限会话」): only an existing account is logged in, invite_code is\\nignored (BR-INV-06 handling for an existing account), nothing is created or bound, and no\\nexisting account → 10405 with data.reason=no_account; the response carries\\nsession_scope=deletion_only. Session scopes: accepts deletion_only.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": false,\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001,\n          20002,\n          20003,\n          44001,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Timestamp"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Nonce"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Sign"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginBySmsRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "phone": "13800138000",\n                "code": "123456",\n                "legal_versions": {\n                  "privacy": 3,\n                  "agreement": 2\n                },\n                "consent_at": "2026-10-02T09:30:00+08:00",\n                "invite_code": "K7Q2MZ"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "Logged in.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a61",\n                    "is_new_user": true,\n                    "tokens": {\n                      "access_token": "example-access-token-one",\n                      "access_expires_at": "2026-10-02T11:30:00+08:00",\n                      "refresh_token": "example-refresh-token-one",\n                      "refresh_expires_at": "2026-11-01T09:30:00+08:00",\n                      "session_scope": "full"\n                    },\n                    "invite_bind": {\n                      "result": "bound",\n                      "code": null\n                    }\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/auth/oauth-attempts": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "createOauthAttempt",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Get a one-time third-party authorization attempt",\n        "description": "Called before every WeChat, Apple or Huawei authorization (BR-ID-04 细则「第三方身份只信\\n服务端换取或验签的结果」). The attempt is bound to the provider, the purpose and this\\ndevice_id (purpose=step_up also to the user and `action`); it is valid once and for the\\nconfigured lifetime (auth.oauth_attempt_ttl_sec). A submission checks it first and\\nconsumes it only after every check passed. The client passes `nonce` to the provider SDK.\\npurpose=step_up requires a logged-in user (otherwise 10001) and `action`; it is issued only\\nto an account without a bound phone (a bound phone → 20001 with `data.fields=[provider]`,\\nBR-ID-08). purpose=step_up with action=account_deletion is inside the 10006 whitelist\\n(BR-ID-31). purpose=payout_bind (WeChat only, no `action`) is the payout authorization of\\nBR-ID-04 细则「收款授权」 and BR-WDR-33 ②: it requires a logged-in user (otherwise 10001)\\nand is bound to the user, this device_id and this app\'s WeChat AppID; the openid it yields\\nis only stored on the payout account — it creates no account, writes no third-party login\\nbinding and issues or refreshes no token. It is consumed by the payout account save, not by\\na login or step-up submission. Storage unavailable → 50001.\\nVersion gate (conditional): not applied when purpose=login, or purpose=step_up with\\naction=account_deletion; applied otherwise. Session scopes: a deletion_only session is\\naccepted only for purpose=login and for purpose=step_up with action=account_deletion. Both\\nper BR-ID-01 细则, which wins on any difference.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "optional",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": "conditional",\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          20001,\n          50001,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {},\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Timestamp"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Nonce"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Sign"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateOauthAttemptRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "provider": "wechat",\n                "purpose": "login"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "A new attempt.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OauthAttemptResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "attempt_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a71",\n                    "nonce": "example-attempt-nonce-value",\n                    "expire_at": "2026-10-02T09:40:00+08:00"\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/auth/login/wechat": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "loginByWechat",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Log in (or register) with WeChat",\n        "description": "Besides the fields every login carries, the body takes only `attempt_id` and the\\nauthorization `code`; any other field (union_id, open_id, nickname, avatar, phone…) is\\n20001 and no account is created. The identity is what the server obtains with the code,\\nwhich is valid once (BR-ID-04 细则). A code or attempt that is invalid, expired, used or does\\nnot match is 20004 (reasons are not told apart); the provider being unavailable, or its\\nanswer lacking the unionid, is 50305 with `data.provider`. A first login creates the account\\nand checks the same-device registration limit (44001, BR-ID-05). Restricted login for clients\\nbelow the minimum version (10405) is added by CT-17a.\\nVersion gate: not applied (session recovery). A client below the minimum version gets a\\nrestricted login: only an account already bound to this identity is logged in, none → 10405\\nwith data.reason=no_account, no account is created (BR-ID-01 细则「受限会话」). Session scopes:\\naccepts deletion_only.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": false,\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001,\n          20004,\n          44001,\n          50305,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Timestamp"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Nonce"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Sign"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginByWechatRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "attempt_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a71",\n                "code": "example-wechat-auth-code",\n                "legal_versions": {\n                  "privacy": 3,\n                  "agreement": 2\n       