empt\'s nonce; the submitted identity_token is checked\\nthe same way and its subject must equal that one, otherwise 20004 (BR-ID-04 细则). Otherwise\\nas WeChat login.\\nVersion gate: not applied (session recovery); restricted login below the minimum version as\\nfor WeChat login (10405 data.reason=no_account). Session scopes: accepts deletion_only.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": false,\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001,\n          20004,\n          44001,\n          50305,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Timestamp"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Nonce"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Sign"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginByAppleRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "attempt_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a71",\n                "identity_token": "example-apple-identity-token",\n                "authorization_code": "example-apple-authorization-code",\n                "legal_versions": {\n                  "privacy": 3,\n                  "agreement": 2\n                },\n                "consent_at": "2026-10-02T09:30:00+08:00"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "Logged in.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a61",\n                    "is_new_user": false,\n                    "tokens": {\n                      "access_token": "example-access-token-one",\n                      "access_expires_at": "2026-10-02T11:30:00+08:00",\n                      "refresh_token": "example-refresh-token-one",\n                      "refresh_expires_at": "2026-11-01T09:30:00+08:00",\n                      "session_scope": "full"\n                    }\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/auth/login/huawei": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "loginByHuawei",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Log in (or register) with a Huawei account",\n        "description": "Phase M-公开. Besides the fields every login carries, the body takes only `attempt_id` and\\n`authorization_code`; otherwise as WeChat login (BR-ID-04 细则). Whether Huawei supports\\nPKCE or returns the nonce is still to be checked (specs/oauth/huawei.md, CT-15i); no field\\nfor it is declared until then.\\nVersion gate: not applied (session recovery); restricted login below the minimum version as\\nfor WeChat login (10405 data.reason=no_account). Session scopes: accepts deletion_only.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": false,\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001,\n          20004,\n          44001,\n          50305,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Timestamp"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Nonce"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Sign"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginByHuaweiRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "attempt_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a71",\n                "authorization_code": "example-huawei-authorization-code",\n                "legal_versions": {\n                  "privacy": 3,\n                  "agreement": 2\n                },\n                "consent_at": "2026-10-02T09:30:00+08:00"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "Logged in.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a61",\n                    "is_new_user": false,\n                    "tokens": {\n                      "access_token": "example-access-token-one",\n                      "access_expires_at": "2026-10-02T11:30:00+08:00",\n                      "refresh_token": "example-refresh-token-one",\n                      "refresh_expires_at": "2026-11-01T09:30:00+08:00",\n                      "session_scope": "full"\n                    }\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/auth/step-up": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "stepUp",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Second verification for a sensitive operation",\n        "description": "Returns a step_up_token bound to `action` (BR-ID-08); the client sends it as the\\nX-Step-Up-Token header of the matching operation (04 §5 step-up row). Exactly one way:\\nan SMS code (`action`, `code`; only for an account with a bound phone; 20002 wrong code,\\n20003 expired), or a new third-party authorization (`action`, `provider`, `attempt_id` and\\nthe credential fields of that provider\'s login: WeChat `code`, Apple `identity_token` and\\n`authorization_code`, Huawei `authorization_code`), which is open only to an account\\nwithout a bound phone (a bound phone → 20001). The server checks the credential as at\\nlogin and accepts only an attempt with purpose=step_up and the same user and action; an\\nidentity other than the one this account bound for that provider is 20004 with\\n`data.reason=identity_mismatch`, an invalid credential or attempt is 20004, the provider\\nbeing unavailable is 50305.\\nVersion gate (conditional): not applied when action=account_deletion; applied otherwise.\\nSession scopes: a deletion_only session is accepted only for action=account_deletion. Both\\nper BR-ID-01 细则, which wins on any difference.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "login",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": "conditional",\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001,\n          20002,\n          20003,\n          20004,\n          50305,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Timestamp"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Nonce"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Sign"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StepUpRequest"\n              },\n              "examples": {\n                "sms": {\n                  "summary": "SMS code",\n                  "value": {\n                    "action": "withdraw",\n                    "code": "123456"\n                  }\n                },\n                "wechat": {\n                  "summary": "WeChat re-authorization (account without a bound phone)",\n                  "value": {\n                    "action": "account_deletion",\n                    "provider": "wechat",\n                    "attempt_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a71",\n                    "code": "example-wechat-auth-code"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "A step-up token for the action.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StepUpResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "step_up_token": "example-step-up-token",\n                    "expire_at": "2026-10-02T09:35:00+08:00"\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/auth/refresh": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "refreshToken",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Rotate the token pair",\n        "description": "Every refresh rotates the refresh token (BR-ID-07). Resubmitting a rotated token outside\\nthe 30-second grace revokes the whole session chain and returns 10404. Clients refresh\\nsingle-flight: N concurrent 10002 trigger one refresh.\\nVersion gate: not applied (session recovery). The scope of the refreshed session is decided\\nagain from this request (X-Platform, X-Channel, X-App-Version), not inherited; the session\\nchain (sid) is unchanged (BR-ID-01 细则「受限会话」). Session scopes: accepts deletion_only.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": false,\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10404\n        ],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Timestamp"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Nonce"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Sign"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RefreshTokenRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "refresh_token": "example-refresh-token-one"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "New token pair.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenPairResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "access_token": "example-access-token-two",\n                    "access_expires_at": "2026-10-02T13:30:00+08:00",\n                    "refresh_token": "example-refresh-token-two",\n                    "refresh_expires_at": "2026-11-01T11:30:00+08:00",\n                    "session_scope": "full"\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/auth/logout": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "logout",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Sign out on this device",\n        "description": "Revokes the session of the access token (its sid and the refresh tokens of that chain,\\nBR-ID-07) and removes the binding between this device\'s push token and the user\\n(拍板第二批 OPS-21; push_tokens is written by the notification module). Other devices of the\\nsame user are not affected. Repeating the call with a token whose session is already\\nrevoked is answered like any revoked token (10002 / 10404 per BR-ID-07), nothing is written.\\nVersion gate: not applied (退出登录). Session scopes: accepts deletion_only (BR-ID-01 细则\\n「受限会话」).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "login",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": false,\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The session is revoked.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EmptyResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {},\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/consents": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "recordConsent",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Record a consent or its withdrawal",\n        "description": "Inserts one consent_records row (insert only, BR-ID-12). Login is not required (04 §6.1\\n鉴权 none): with a valid access token the row is user level (user_id and this device_id);\\nwithout one it is device level (device_id from X-Device-Id, user_id empty). A device\\nwithout a registered device_id cannot record (BR-ID-12: the first-launch consent is kept\\nlocally and reported right after device registration). The current state of a subject and\\ntype is the row with the latest server_at; server_at is the server clock, client_at is the\\ntap time on the device. Withdrawing the privacy consent (type=privacy, accepted=false, the\\nprivacy center 【撤回同意】) is always a device-level row even with a token: subject is this\\ndevice, user_id is kept only as an association, other devices\' user-level state is not\\nchanged; the server then revokes this device\'s sessions and install_secret and clears its\\npush token, and the client enters basic mode (BR-ID-13). Other withdrawals (for example\\nai_third_party, BR-AI-13) follow the user / device rule above.\\n`type` never takes labor_agreement (signed only through the labor agreement endpoint,\\nBR-WDR-31). `channel` never takes login_merge, h5_landing or withdraw_flow: those rows are\\nwritten by the server (login merge, landing registration, labor agreement signing).\\nA field outside these values → 20001 with data.fields.\\nVersion gate (conditional): not applied to accepted=false of any type, nor to type privacy\\nor agreement; applied otherwise. Session scopes: a deletion_only session is accepted only\\nfor the same requests (any withdrawal, and privacy or agreement records). Both per BR-ID-01\\n细则, which wins on any difference.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "optional",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": "conditional",\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {},\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RecordConsentRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "type": "privacy",\n                "version": 3,\n                "accepted": true,\n                "channel": "first_launch",\n                "client_at": "2026-10-02T09:30:00+08:00"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The consent row is recorded.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EmptyResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {},\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/auth/h5-token": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "issueH5Token",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Exchange the native session for an h5_token",\n        "description": "The native app gets an h5_token (aud=h5) for its trusted H5 pages; lifetime and scope per\\nBR-ID-32. A read_only token calling anything but GET is 10403 with\\ndata.reason=h5_read_only, decided by the server from the HTTP method. Version gate:\\napplied (BR-ID-01 细则 interface table). Session scopes: not marked, so a deletion_only\\nsession gets 10405.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "login",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": true,\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/IssueH5TokenRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "scope": "standard"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "A new h5_token.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/H5TokenResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "token": "placeholder",\n                    "expire_at": "2026-10-02T10:00:00+08:00",\n                    "scope": "standard"\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/unions/bindings": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "listUnionBindings",\n        "tags": [\n          "union"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Authorization state per platform",\n        "description": "One item per platform. A platform with an unreleased binding gives that binding\'s status;\\notherwise released when a released binding exists, otherwise unbound. Pinduoduo reports\\nthe authorization of the self-purchase promotion slot. No released_at, cooldown_until,\\naccount name, nickname or avatar (BR-ID-17 细则「授权方式」「授权管理页」; how the page\\nshows each status is in BR-ID-17 细则).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "login",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "Authorization state per platform.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UnionBindingsResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "items": [\n                      {\n                        "platform": "taobao",\n                        "status": "active"\n                      },\n                      {\n                        "platform": "jd",\n                        "status": "unbound"\n                      },\n                      {\n                        "platform": "pdd",\n                        "status": "released"\n                      }\n                    ]\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n  