share gives only masked_order_no, and an item whose bought\\nproduct is not the shared one (is_other_product=true) has title and image_url null — both\\ntrimmed by the server. Shared orders exclude referral-commission orders. status_group\\ngroups display_status on the server; q matches a self-purchase order by its exact parent or\\nchild order number, otherwise titles; shared orders are matched by the visible title only.\\nGrouping, search and projection rules are only in BR-TEXT-02 细则「订单列表的状态分组与查找」\\n「订单的检索范围与分享单的投影」. earliest_visible_date is the first day in range\\n(null when unlimited; BR-ID-30 细则「订单类记录」). For a pre-sale order in DEPOSIT_PAID,\\npay_amount_fen is the deposit paid, null when the platform does not report it\\n(BR-TEXT-02 细则「预售单的付款金额」, wording pending CAP-*-07).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "login",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "scope",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": true,\n            "description": "self = my own purchases; share = orders bought through my shares.",\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrderScope"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "status_group",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Status group (enum order_status_group); absent = all.",\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrderStatusGroup"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "display_status",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrderDisplayStatus"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "platform",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlatformCode"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "q",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Order number or title words, at most 40 characters (BR-TEXT-02 细则).",\n            "schema": {\n              "type": "string",\n              "minLength": 1,\n              "maxLength": 40\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "paid_month",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Month of payment, YYYY-MM in +08:00; only months in the visible range.",\n            "schema": {\n              "type": "string",\n              "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])$"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Cursor"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Limit"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "A page of orders.",\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrderListResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                  