neven with price_changed=false (BR-PRICE-13).\\nA request stopped by 30101, 30102 or 30111 and sent again after the user authorized is a\\nnew request with a new Idempotency-Key; the original key is only for retrying the same\\nrequest (BR-ID-10 细则). 30101 / 30102 carry auth_url, state and auth_methods; 30111\\ncarries auth_jump.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "optional",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": true,\n        "x-min-version-gate": true,\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          30101,\n          30102,\n          30103,\n          30111,\n          30121,\n          30141,\n          30143,\n          30144,\n          30151,\n          30153,\n          50301,\n          50303,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {},\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Timestamp"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Nonce"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Sign"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LinkId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content":