k_id}/tpwd: returned only when the server judges the request\'s\\nUser-Agent to be outside WeChat and the link has a token, otherwise null (a request\\nwithout User-Agent counts as WeChat). The User-Agent is the client\'s claim, only used to\\nadapt the page, not a guarantee of content isolation (BR-ATTR-10 细则). open_in_app_url\\nis the LinkLanding deep link, null while share.open_in_app.enabled is off (BR-ATTR-05\\n细则「App 内打开链接的入口」). Only links with pid_scene=share are answered; any other,\\nunknown or of another app → 30144. The response carries Cache-Control: no-store (not\\ncached by the CDN). Not signed; no X-Device-Id required.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          30144\n        ],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LinkId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The share page card.",\n            "headers": {\n              "Cache-Control": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/NoStore"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SharePageResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "